flowchart LR
  A[checkout] --> B[validate policy]
  B --> C{baseline set?}
  C -->|yes| D[diff --check]
  C -->|no| E[scan paths]
  D --> E
  E --> F[audit static]
  F --> G{SARIF out?}
  G -->|yes| H[write SARIF preview]
  G -->|no| I[annotate findings]
  H --> I
  I --> J{fail-on gate}
  J -->|findings| K[exit 1]
  J -->|clean| L[exit 0]
